Fault Tolerance on AWS 🛡️

High availability is not automatic.
It must be designed.

Common mistakes:
❌ Single-AZ deployments
❌ One NAT Gateway for everything
❌ No health checks configured
❌ No rollback strategy

Fault-tolerant architecture includes:
✔ Multi-AZ deployments
✔ Load balancers with health checks
✔ Auto Scaling Groups
✔ Graceful degradation strategy

Important mindset:
Don’t design for “no failure”.
Design for “failure handling”.

Cloud makes scaling easy.
Resilience still requires engineering discipline.
